{"2368400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Complex Loop", "steam_appid": 2368400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>「No matter how many times, I will never give up saving you.」</strong><br><br>It's impossible to forecast the ending.<br>Will you recognize the foreshadowing of the story?<br><br>This game will give you an experience of sci-fi movie. An adventure of time loops awaits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Introduction to the Game】</h2>This is a story of time loops between past and future, described from complex and multiple perspectives.<br>Within a time limit of 20 minutes, your mission is to save a mysterious girl died from an explosion accident.<br>Travel to the past, solve puzzles to explore, use memory and strategy to fight, and reveal the truth behind the accident 1 year ago.<br>It will take you about 6-8 hours to clear the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368400/extras/d7b12f0b8b9b8d9b01fa58640c95bcfa.avif?t=1718166894\" width=600 height=278 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Synopsis of Story】</h2>Rain Climber is made a scapegoat after finding her boss involved in drug transaction. She's transferred to an institute and forced to join an experiment.<br>Her mission is to travel to the past, and rescue Eltea, a girl who died from an explosion accident 1 year ago.<br>However, on her way to approach Eltea, she's constantly assualted by some strange enemies, who seem to be able to read her intentions.<br>The fate, is being rewritten.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368400/extras/c0e1b59761b4a0875e8f2862d5cd3537.avif?t=1718166894\" width=600 height=278 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Exploration and Puzzles】</h2>In exploration stages, you'll need to solve puzzles by making use of items and hints.<br>There're also some stages for you to talk with various NPCs and collect information.<br>If you find it hard to clear a stage, feel free to use the Help Mode and hints. They'll be helpful!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368400/extras/7dae3b1bf535075ce8de761d10a14111.avif?t=1718166894\" width=600 height=278 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Unique Battles】</h2>To fight with enemies, you'll have to memorized some shapes of pictures and read numerical hints.<br>Challenge your brain and win the battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Japanese Voiceover】</h2>The main story is in full Japanese Voiceover.<br>Get immersed in the story and enjoy the awesome performance of Japanese CVs!<br>●Rain Climer（安西 麻里那）<br>●Nara Fraycis（燈咲 唯羽）<br>●Grey（アサイ ユウスケ）<br>●Megan Apple（蠍媛）<br>●Jason Lieberman（コガリョータ）<br>●Eltea（安西 麻里那）<br>●Peter Cromwell（羽山 太洋）<br>●Arthur Kilburn（雅之 雅之）<br>●Susan Edwards（Anonymous）<br><br>If you like the game, give us a comment. Have fun in the complex loops and good luck!", "about_the_game": "<strong>「No matter how many times, I will never give up saving you.」</strong><br><br>It's impossible to forecast the ending.<br>Will you recognize the foreshadowing of the story?<br><br>This game will give you an experience of sci-fi movie. An adventure of time loops awaits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Introduction to the Game】</h2>This is a story of time loops between past and future, described from complex and multiple perspectives.<br>Within a time limit of 20 minutes, your mission is to save a mysterious girl died from an explosion accident.<br>Travel to the past, solve puzzles to explore, use memory and strategy to fight, and reveal the truth behind the accident 1 year ago.<br>It will take you about 6-8 hours to clear the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368400/extras/d7b12f0b8b9b8d9b01fa58640c95bcfa.avif?t=1718166894\" width=600 height=278 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Synopsis of Story】</h2>Rain Climber is made a scapegoat after finding her boss involved in drug transaction. She's transferred to an institute and forced to join an experiment.<br>Her mission is to travel to the past, and rescue Eltea, a girl who died from an explosion accident 1 year ago.<br>However, on her way to approach Eltea, she's constantly assualted by some strange enemies, who seem to be able to read her intentions.<br>The fate, is being rewritten.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368400/extras/c0e1b59761b4a0875e8f2862d5cd3537.avif?t=1718166894\" width=600 height=278 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Exploration and Puzzles】</h2>In exploration stages, you'll need to solve puzzles by making use of items and hints.<br>There're also some stages for you to talk with various NPCs and collect information.<br>If you find it hard to clear a stage, feel free to use the Help Mode and hints. They'll be helpful!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368400/extras/7dae3b1bf535075ce8de761d10a14111.avif?t=1718166894\" width=600 height=278 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Unique Battles】</h2>To fight with enemies, you'll have to memorized some shapes of pictures and read numerical hints.<br>Challenge your brain and win the battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Japanese Voiceover】</h2>The main story is in full Japanese Voiceover.<br>Get immersed in the story and enjoy the awesome performance of Japanese CVs!<br>●Rain Climer（安西 麻里那）<br>●Nara Fraycis（燈咲 唯羽）<br>●Grey（アサイ ユウスケ）<br>●Megan Apple（蠍媛）<br>●Jason Lieberman（コガリョータ）<br>●Eltea（安西 麻里那）<br>●Peter Cromwell（羽山 太洋）<br>●Arthur Kilburn（雅之 雅之）<br>●Susan Edwards（Anonymous）<br><br>If you like the game, give us a comment. Have fun in the complex loops and good luck!", "short_description